# {{ .App.Name }} Skills Router

This directory contains generated OpenCLI skill packages. This router exists for agent loaders that require a `SKILL.md` at the selected folder root.

Before acting:

1. Pick the matching command-group skill from the index.
2. Read that group's `SKILL.md`.
3. Use this router only for navigation; do not treat it as the complete operating guide.

```bash
{{ .App.Name }} skills list
{{ .App.Name }} skills read <skill>
{{ .App.Name }} skills read <skill> references/command-routing.md
```

| Skill | Commands | Guide |
| --- | ---: | --- |
{{- range .App.Groups }}
| `{{ skillName . }}` | {{ len .Operations }} | [`{{ skillName . }}/SKILL.md`]({{ skillName . }}/SKILL.md) |
{{- end }}
